  "releaseNotes": "'## [10.3.0](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/compare/v10.2.4...v10.3.0) (2026-03-03)\n\n### Features\n\n* Extended PatchAsync with SSA parameters (fieldManager, force, dryRun) ([#1047](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1047)) ([cc4a0fc](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/cc4a0fc66c5706b6dadc1dfe3f40898b239afaa5))\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **CRDS:** Handle Optional Min/Max Length in LengthAttribute ([#1051](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1051)) ([cf3fb98](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/cf3fb98a1dead7facb32fec620895024e77f54b1)), closes [#741](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/741) [#805](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/805)\n* **reconciler:** prevent unnecessary updates when auto-attaching finalizers ([#1057](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1057)) ([0bf2017](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/0bf2017ad0b5089b1030e309a5ab796a595d77b3)), closes [#1001](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1001)\n\n### Dependencies\n\n* **core:** update dependency sonaranalyzer.csharp to 10.20.0.135146 ([#1058](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1058)) ([73cd74c](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/73cd74c3df7a0ecef08993713481f0172df8c893))\n* **docs:** update dependency @easyops-cn/docusaurus-search-local to v0.55.1 ([#1059](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1059)) ([8e67bf9](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/8e67bf98da5fb23657b4f70310bf91f76a78c11c))\n* **test:** update dependency kubernetesclient to v19 ([#1056](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1056)) ([5f3d510](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/5f3d51021be3be219ad357c62494c80205acb322))\n* **test:** update dependency microsoft.net.test.sdk to 18.3.0 ([#1055](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1055)) ([0f42179](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/0f42179d5d96f568c54cf69673924dce531d5152))\n\n### Documentation\n\n* clarify webhook naming conventions in README ([#1050](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1050)) ([4b247de](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/4b247dedbf83821a04442c8650d6a07c3cb0e755)), closes [#1049](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1049)\n'",
